@startuml
!include ../../../../plantuml/sodexo-theme.puml

title Accommodation booking data model
caption Corporate context governs the journey; snapshots and audit evidence preserve every decision.

left to right direction
hide stereotype

skinparam linetype ortho
skinparam nodesep 42
skinparam ranksep 56
skinparam ArrowFontSize 12
skinparam ArrowColor SODEXO_MUTED
skinparam ArrowFontColor SODEXO_MUTED
skinparam rectangle {
  FontSize 14
  BorderThickness 1.6
  RoundCorner 18
  Padding 18
}

rectangle "<color:#2B3797><b>CORPORATE CONTEXT</b></color>\n\n<b>Corporate Client</b>\nTraveller Profile\nDestination Site\nTravel Policy" as Context #F5F6FC

rectangle "<color:#2B3797><b>01 · REQUEST</b></color>\n\n<b>Accommodation Request</b>\ndates · guests · purpose\nstatus" as Request #FFFFFF

rectangle "<color:#2B3797><b>02 · DECIDE</b></color>\n\n<b>Approval Decision</b>\ndecision · reason\napprover" as Approval #FFFFFF

rectangle "<color:#ED1C24><b>03 · BOOK</b></color>\n\n<b>Supplier Booking</b>\nsupplier reference\nstatus · confirmation" as Booking #FBDADD

rectangle "<color:#9A5A00><b>04 · VALIDATE</b></color>\n\n<b>Invoice</b>\nstay · taxes · fees\ncredits" as Invoice #FFF4DD

rectangle "<color:#9A5A00><b>05 · SETTLE</b></color>\n\n<b>Payment Instruction</b>\napproved amount\nsettlement status" as Payment #FFF4DD

rectangle "<color:#187A5A><b>IMMUTABLE SNAPSHOTS</b></color>\n\n<b>Offer Snapshot</b>\nproperty · room · price · terms\n\n<b>Policy Snapshot</b>\npolicy version · result · exception" as Snapshots #DDF2E9

rectangle "<color:#187A5A><b>AUDIT & EVENTS</b></color>\n\n<b>Audit Event</b>\nactor · change · correlation ID\n\n<b>Outbox Event</b>\npayload · delivery status · attempts" as Evidence #DDF2E9

Context -down-> Request

Request -down-> Approval
Approval -down-> Booking
Booking -down-> Invoice
Invoice -down-> Payment

Request -right-> Snapshots
Booking -right-> Evidence

Snapshots -[hidden]down-> Evidence

@enduml
